<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0219_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\r*SNIIIFF*...\n...\rHuh? It’s mornin’ already?\nI been up since Tuesday!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\r*sniff sniff*...\n...\rHuh? WHAT?! It’s that late?!\nWhere my pants? Forget it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\rHmm. The sun goin’ down...\n*sniff*\r...So this what they call\n“twilight,” right? Feels like noon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\rHmm... Interestin’... *sniff*\n...\rHuh? Oh! My bad, my bad!\nI was just... readin’. A book. Yeah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\r*SNIIIIIFF*...\n...\rHuh? Company?\nAt this hour? I ain’t dressed!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">*sniff* Sorry to keep you waitin’!\rWelcome to the world of Pokémon!\rMy name is Professor Oak.\rBut everybody call me the\nPokémon Professor. *sniff*\rBefore we go any further, I gotta\ntell you a few things about\fthis world! Ignore my drawers.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">First I’ma tell you the\nimportant stuff about this game.\n\nTap whatever topic you\nwanna know more about on the\nbottom screen. *sniff*</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma explain the controls.\n\nYou control this game by\ntouchin’ the bottom screen, also\ncalled the Touch Screen.\n\nTap the panel in the\nbottom right of the Touch Screen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tap the Touch Screen\nlike that to pick stuff\nand keep the convo\ngoin’. *sniff*</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can also keep goin’ by pressin’\nthe A Button when you see the\nA Button icon on the Touch Screen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Different buttons gon’ pop up\non the Touch Screen dependin’ on\nwhat’s goin’ on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Next, I’ma explain the buttons.\n\nYou move your character\naround the screen with the\n+Control Pad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Next, I’ma explain the buttons.\n\nUse the +Control Pad to move\nyour character.\n\nYou can use the +Control\nPad to pick stuff, too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can use the buttons\ninstead of touchin’ the\nTouch Screen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Confirm, check stuff,\ntalk, scroll text.\n\nBack out, cancel,\nnever mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Move around the menus.\n\nPress to use a Key Item, like\na stolen Bicycle you\nregistered ahead of time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If this mark show up in the\ntext box, there’s buttons\nyou can tap on the\nTouch Screen below.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You followin’ me so far?\n*sniff* {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ’bout to step into a world\nwhere you gon’ go on a big\nadventure all your own.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Talk to people and check stuff\neverywhere you go, the blocks,\nthe roads, the alleys.\nGet the word on the street\nfrom everybody you can.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">New paths open up when you\nhelp people out, handle\nyour business, and solve problems.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sometimes people gon’ run up\non you for a fight.\nOther times, opps gon’\njump out the grass at you.\n\nGet past all that and\nyou gon’ get real powerful.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">But your come-up ain’t\njust about bein’ powerful.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Out there, we hope you\nmeet a whole lot of people\nand, through them,\ngrow as a person.\n\nThat’s the most important part\nof this whole thing. *sniff*</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This world is full of\ncreatures called Pokémon. *sniff*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We humans roll with Pokémon\nlike homies.\rSometimes we kick it together,\nsometimes we hustle together.\rSome people throw hands with their\nPokémon and get real close\fwith ’em. Ride or die.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Now, tell me a lil somethin’\nabout yourself. *sniff sniff*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a boy?\nOr a girl?\fI can’t see too good right now. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you a boy, then? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you a girl, then? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s your name, youngblood?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your name {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your name {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0219_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou ready?\rYour come-up story is\nabout to start.\rGood times, bad times,\nthere’s so much waitin’ on you!\rDreams! Hustle! *SNIFF*\nLet’s go run the world of Pokémon!\rI’ll see you later! Don’t tell your\nmama what I was wearin’!\r</language>
	</row>
